---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="de">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
		<title>404 – Seite nicht gefunden / Page not found | VibePerform</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Seite nicht gefunden. Page not found. Wählen Sie Ihre Sprache und fahren Sie fort. Choose your language and continue." />
	</head>
	<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
		<main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-3xl items-center px-6 py-16">
			<article class="w-full rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8 shadow-2xl sm:p-12">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-purple-300">HTTP 404</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Seite nicht gefunden <span class="text-slate-400">/</span> Page not found</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">Die angeforderte Adresse existiert nicht. Wählen Sie einen passenden Einstieg. <span lang="en">The address you requested does not exist. Choose a page to continue.</span></p>
				<div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
					<nav aria-label="Deutsch" lang="de">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Deutsch</h2>
						<ul class="mt-3 grid gap-3">
							<li><a class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-purple-200 hover:border-purple-400" href="/de/">Startseite</a></li>
							<li><a class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-purple-200 hover:border-purple-400" href="/de/leistungen/">Leistungen</a></li>
							<li><a class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-purple-200 hover:border-purple-400" href="/de/workshops/">Workshops</a></li>
						</ul>
					</nav>
					<nav aria-label="English" lang="en">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">English</h2>
						<ul class="mt-3 grid gap-3">
							<li><a class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-purple-200 hover:border-purple-400" href="/en/">Home</a></li>
							<li><a class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-purple-200 hover:border-purple-400" href="/en/services/">Services</a></li>
							<li><a class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-purple-200 hover:border-purple-400" href="/en/workshops/">Workshops</a></li>
						</ul>
					</nav>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-400"><a class="underline hover:text-white" href="/sitemap.xml">XML-Sitemap / XML sitemap</a></p>
			</article>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
